@startuml
title Run record lifecycle

[*] --> Off : workflow config switches run statistics off
Off : no tracing, no run records
Off : existing records stay readable

[*] --> Open : first observed event of an execution\n(random run id created locally)
Open : events append to the local trace
Open : each target-naming Prism call sets target and role
Open : subagent start inherits the starter's target and role
Open --> Open : Prism call / tool call / model message

Open --> Ending : observed session end or subagent stop
Open --> Ending : quiet > 30 min with no tool running,\nor quiet > 24 h, seen by the next Prism run\nof another session (pending marker age)
Ending : read bounded transcript usage (once per message id)
Ending : replay events into per-target segments
Ending : build one content-free record per attributed slice

Ending --> Recorded : appendRecord(projectRoot, {runs, initiative, slice}, run-id, entry)\nfor every attributed slice, in the project its call read
Ending --> Pending : hook time limit, append or transcript failure,\nor entry lock younger than 30 s
Pending : counts reported as in progress
Pending : coverage lowered on failure
Pending : marker or claim kept until every run is recorded
Pending --> Ending : next Prism hook or MCP read in the project

Recorded : immutable shared record
Recorded : run sealed in the local trace;\nlate events inside it become losses
Recorded : unattributed cost stays in the local session total
Recorded --> Open : later event of the same execution\nstarts a new run
Recorded --> [*]
@enduml
